# The oracle harnesses are ours: they supply a block lookup, a minimal entity,
# and a text protocol, and they reimplement no game logic. They are committed so
# that anyone with a prepared workspace can re-run the differential gates, which
# is what makes those gates a check rather than a claim. Decompiled sources and
# jars stay ignored above and below.
!internal/oracle/java/*.java
*.tiny
*.tsrg
*.srg
*.csrg
